{
  "_doc": "Master -> app imageset map for the vertical slice (tools/assets/integrate.py). `master` is an art folder under design/art (the lock-light re-lock wins, then .png, then .webp). target `games` writes a flat PNG into PofuGames/Resources at `scale` px per point, fitted into `points` and never upscaled; target `world` names an imageset baked into World.xcassets by design/prototypes/interactions/tools/preblur.py (integrate.py runs it, then checks the imageset exists). target `ui` is the same flat bake into PofuDesignSystem/Resources (the painted menu art, named paint-*; PofuPaint in the design system lists them).",
  "targets": {
    "games": "Packages/PofuKit/Sources/PofuGames/Resources",
    "world": "Packages/PofuKit/Sources/PofuWorld/Resources/World.xcassets",
    "ui": "Packages/PofuKit/Sources/PofuDesignSystem/Resources"
  },
